awardee A here, has 4. Contract [1], for 14,250 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December and the high number of awardees do not prove improper actions. These patterns could reflect market conditions or budget constraints, not wrongdoing.\nWhat can be checked: Check the contracts' dates and awardees to see if multiple contracts cover the same need. Review the December contracts to determine if they align with the body's overall spending patterns.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["ZoFKZmJZuIxPpzdqOdhuWg%3D%3D","7zOzSlS7AYYadbH3CysQuQ%3D%3D","fAz%2BZXizdMdeKgd8LfVV9g%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}